      en: ["Menongue is situated on the banks of the Cuebe River.", "Until 1975, the city was officially named Serpa Pinto.", "It is the final stop of the 860 km long Moçâmedes Railway.", "Cuando Cubango province is one of the least populated in Angola.", "Menongue is home to a major Angolan air force base.", "The region is part of the Kavango-Zambezi Transfrontier Conservation Area."],
