      en: ["The city was originally founded in 1587 as Benguela Velha.", "It was officially renamed to Porto Amboim in 1923.", "The railway line to Gabela was 123 kilometers long with a 600mm gauge.", "Porto Amboim is a key hub for the Paenal shipyard joint venture.", "The city is located approximately 270 kilometers south of Luanda.", "The climate is arid with an average annual temperature of around 24 degrees Celsius."],
